                                                "example_id": "4f93239f-cd32-4898-bbdc-466ab5f7dbba",
                                                "sense_id": "cfc12599-68b0-37f4-8946-58831ba81515",
                                                "text": "“You’re a dutiful and affectionate little boy, you are, ain’t you?” said Mr. Weller, “to come a bonnetin’ your father in his old age?”"
